# The engine wasm is fetched (channel in ship, same-origin in dev), never
# committed: the viewer build emits it into assets/web for dev serving, and git
# ignores it. This lives here, one level above the build's outDir, because that
# dir is emptied on every build (vite emptyOutDir) — an ignore placed inside it
# is wiped and porthole_bg.wasm resurfaces as untracked every build.
assets/web/porthole_bg.wasm
